review:
Absolutely amazing first person shooter in a Wild West setting, last game in Call of Juarez series. This game is extremely fun with frenetic action, bullet time and interesting storytelling. It is not necessary to play previous games in a series because this story line is unrelated to them. Must play for every FPS fan!

Pros:
- Visual design aged very well;
- Cool "unreliable narrator" narrative technique;
- Satisfying gunplay;
- Awesome soundtrack;
- Great storytelling;
- Amazing art style;
- Cool progression system;
- Responsive controls;
- Fun fast paced gameplay;
- Amazing optimisation;
- Great sound design;
- Awesome voice acting;

Cons:
- Short campaign (but game has couple game mods and New game +);
